<title>USA: SEI Corp changes name to SEI Investments.</title>
<headline>SEI Corp changes name to SEI Investments.</headline>
<dateline>OAKS, Pa. 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>SEI Corp, a suburban Philadelphia financial services company, said Thursday it has changed its name to SEI Investments Co.</p>
<p>SEI said in a release that the company began as a trust technology firm and evolved into a &quot;global investment resource, providing clients with comprehensive business solutions combining asset management and technology.&quot;</p>
